## Interface: 16001
## Title: Daylight |cffa335eeRecipes|r
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DaylightRecipes\Media\icon.png
## Notes: A Daylight UI plugin: a pane beside the profession window with the picked recipe's material costs, skill-up chance, sale and disenchant value, and every recipe you don't know yet with where to get it. Uses DaylightMogul's prices when it's loaded.
